    "detail": "In the loop that resolves pending reruns, a completed job whose conclusion is neither `success` nor in `bad` hits `else continue`. Examples are `neutral` or `skipped`, or a failure while main is red on that check. The row stays `rerunning`. When the rollup is SUCCESS, `classifyCi` keeps returning false because a pending rerun exists, so `record()` returns null on every poll. That means repeated REST inspection and `complete = false` for the repository."
   }
  ]
